flowchart TD
 Camera[Private configured camera monitor] --> Local
 Browser[Browser console] --> API[FastAPI and bounded upload tickets]
 API --> Local[Local SQLite documents and durable jobs]
 Local --> Worker[Separate measurement worker]
 Worker --> Vision[OpenCV 5 stabilization and displacement]
 Vision --> Signal[Welch spectrum and conditional interval]
 Signal --> Agent[Deterministic agent and baseline comparison]
 Agent --> Evidence[Trace, plots and audified displacement]
 Agent --> Human[Human approval with retained reason]
 Human --> Receipt[Local delivery receipt]
 subgraph Prepared[Prepared AWS target - not deployed]
 Edge[CloudFront and private S3 web] --> Compute[COOL Graviton EC2]
 Raw[S3 raw uploads with lifecycle] --> Queue[SQS and dead-letter queue]
 Queue --> Compute
 Compute --> Records[DynamoDB and evidence S3]
 Records --> Gate[Human-approved SNS notification]
 Guard[Budgets, CloudWatch and scheduled stop]
 end
 API -. deployment boundary .-> Edge
